输入: 
Olympic 表:
+-------------+-------------+---------------+---------------+
| country     | gold_medals | silver_medals | bronze_medals |
+-------------+-------------+---------------+---------------+
| China       | 10          | 10            | 20            |
| South Sudan | 0           | 0             | 1             |
| USA         | 10          | 10            | 20            |
| Israel      | 2           | 2             | 3             |
| Egypt       | 2           | 2             | 2             |
+-------------+-------------+---------------+---------------+
输出: 
+-------------+-------------+---------------+---------------+
| country     | gold_medals | silver_medals | bronze_medals |
+-------------+-------------+---------------+---------------+
| China       | 10          | 10            | 20            |
| USA         | 10          | 10            | 20            |
| Israel      | 2           | 2             | 3             |
| Egypt       | 2           | 2             | 2             |
| South Sudan | 0           | 0             | 1             |
+-------------+-------------+---------------+---------------+
解释: 
（当奖牌数相同时）中国与美国的排名先后依据两国名称的字母顺序决定。由于“China”在字母顺序上排在“USA”之前，因此中国位列在前。
以色列排在埃及之前，因为它的铜牌更多。', 'EASY', '数据库', 'Create table If Not Exists Olympic (country varchar(50), gold_medals int, silver_medals int, bronze_medals int);
