- Chicken, Extra Cheese, Pepperoni：总花费是 $1.45 (Chicken $0.55，Extra Cheese $0.40，Pepperoni $0.50)。
输出表根据总花费降序排序。', 'MEDIUM', '数据库', 'Create table if not exists Toppings(topping_name varchar(100), cost decimal(5,2));
